 :itonami.blueprint/implemented-slice
 "Full Actors-pattern implementation (Governor + MarketEntry-LLM mock advisor + langgraph-clj StateGraph + append-only audit ledger + MemStore/DatomicStore via langchain-store.core), adapted from the cloud-itonami-iso3166-gnb reference implementation (the closest architectural match: a fellow Lusophone jurisdiction) and cloud-itonami-iso3166-caf: src/marketentry/{facts,governor,phase,sim,operation,registry,store,marketentryllm}.cljc + full test suite (governor contract, store contract MemStore≡DatomicStore parity, registry pure-function, phase, facts) + src/statute/facts.cljk + docs/business-model.md + docs/operator-guide.md. The jurisdiction dossier (marketentry.facts) is grounded in primary-source Boletim da República gazette PDFs (Decreto n.º 79/2022 for the current Regulamento de Contratação de Empreitada de Obras Públicas, Fornecimento de Bens e Prestação de Serviços ao Estado; Lei n.º 13/2023 for the current Lei do Trabalho) read directly via pdftotext, UFSA's own government website (ufsa.gov.mz) for the flagship Cadastro Único mechanism (Artigos 43-45, a genuine two-registry design: eligible suppliers + a separate Impedidos/debarred registry), BAU's own site (bau.gov.mz, Decreto n.º 29/2023) for business licensing/registration, the Autoridade Tributária de Moçambique's own site (at.gov.mz) for NUIT, and a Wayback Machine snapshot of APIEX's own site (apiex.gov.mz itself blocked every direct fetch attempt this session with its own bot-detection page) for Lei n.º 8/2023 (Lei de Investimento Privado). The governor is SIX checks (not a richer sibling's seven -- no analog of AGO's/MLI's/CAF's separate tax-ID/DGID check, mirroring cloud-itonami-iso3166-gnb precedent), because the dossier does not ground a distinct NUIT-establishing-decree check separate from ordinary Cadastro Único registration. Facts this iteration could NOT independently confirm (a Conservatória do Registo das Entidades Legais (CREL) citation; the specific decree establishing the NUIT regime itself; the specific instrument naming APIEX as Lei n.º 8/2023's own Art. 22 §3/§4 'competent entity') are stated as honest gaps in src/marketentry/facts.cljk's namespace docstring, not invented."}
